#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj ponavljanja za Bulk Walk"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Za SNMPv2 i SNMPv3 uređaje, veličina max-repetitions za SNMP Bulk Walk. Podrazumijevano je 'Automatski otkrij pri ponovnom indeksiranju'. Za veoma velike svičeve, servere visokih performansi, Jumbo Frame mreže ili za WAN veze sa visokim kašnjenjem, povećanje ove vrijednosti može poboljšati performanse pollera. Više podataka se pakuje u jedan SNMP paket što može smanjiti vrijeme izvršavanja upita podataka. Međutim, neki uređaji mogu potpuno odbiti da odgovore na pakete sa prevelikom vrijednošću max-repetitions. Ovo posebno važi za IoT uređaje manje snage ili manje ugrađene IT uređaje. Posebnu pažnju treba obratiti i na ukupni MTU mrežne putanje jer postavljanje previsoke vrijednosti može dovesti do fragmentacije paketa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect on Re-Index"
msgstr "Automatski otkrij pri ponovnom indeksiranju"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Detect/Set on first Re-Index"
msgstr "Automatski otkrij/postavi pri prvom ponovnom indeksiranju"

