msgid "The path to the composer binary.  Composer is required when installing or upgrading a Cacti instance whose include/vendor directory is not pre-packaged, for example a Git checkout."
msgstr "Putanja do izvršne datoteke composer. Composer je potreban prilikom instalacije ili nadogradnje Cacti instance čiji direktorij include/vendor nije unaprijed upakovan, na primjer kod preuzimanja putem Git-a."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "FPing Binary Path"
msgstr "Putanja do izvršne datoteke FPing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to the FPing binary file which provides for a more precise ping command."
msgstr "Putanja do izvršne datoteke FPing koja omogućava precizniju naredbu ping."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cacti Log Path"
msgstr "Putanja do Cacti dnevnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to your Cacti log file (if blank, defaults to &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"
msgstr "Putanja do vaše datoteke Cacti dnevnika (ako je prazno, podrazumijevano je &lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Standard Error Log Path"
msgstr "Putanja do dnevnika standardnih grešaka Pollera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with Cacti's Data Collectors, set this file path and the Data Collectors standard error will be redirected to this file"
msgstr "Ako imate problema sa Cacti sakupljačima podataka, postavite ovu putanju datoteke i standardna greška sakupljača podataka bit će preusmjerena u ovu datoteku"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Dnevnik otklanjanja grešaka za Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Log file where Boost will write its information to.  It much be located in the same directory as the Cacti Log file."
msgstr "Ovo je datoteka dnevnika u koju će Boost upisivati svoje informacije. Mora se nalaziti u istom direktoriju kao i datoteka Cacti dnevnika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Alternate Poller Path"
msgstr "Alternativna putanja Pollera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spine Binary File Location"
msgstr "Lokacija izvršne datoteke Spine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine binary."
msgstr "Putanja do izvršne datoteke Spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spine Config File Path"
msgstr "Putanja do konfiguracijske datoteke za Spine"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The path to Spine configuration file.  By default, in the cwd of Spine, or /etc if not specified."
msgstr "Putanja do konfiguracijske datoteke za Spine. Podrazumijevano se nalazi u radnom direktoriju (cwd) za Spine, ili u /etc ako nije navedeno."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Auto Clean"
msgstr "Automatsko čišćenje RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automatically archive or delete RRDfiles when their corresponding Data Sources are removed from Cacti"
msgstr "Automatski arhiviraj ili obriši RRD datoteke kada se njihovi odgovarajući izvori podataka uklone iz Cacti-ja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Auto Clean Method"
msgstr "Metoda automatskog čišćenja RRD datoteka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The method used to Clean RRDfiles from Cacti after their Data Sources are deleted."
msgstr "Metoda koja se koristi za čišćenje RRD datoteka iz Cacti-ja nakon brisanja njihovih izvora podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Archive directory"
msgstr "Direktorij za arhiviranje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the directory where RRDfiles are <strong>moved</strong> for archiving"
msgstr "Ovo je direktorij u koji se RRD datoteke <strong>premještaju</strong> radi arhiviranja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Settings"
msgstr "Postavke dnevnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Destination"
msgstr "Odredište dnevnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How will Cacti handle event logging."
msgstr "Kako će Cacti obrađivati zapisivanje događaja u dnevnik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Actions"
msgstr "Radnje dnevnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What Log Actions do you wish to provide to the Cacti Administrator.  You can grant either purge, rotate, or both purge and rotate.  Base files can be both purged and rotated, and already rotated files can only be purged if you grant that permission."
msgstr "Koje radnje dnevnika želite omogućiti Cacti administratoru. Možete odobriti čišćenje, rotaciju ili i čišćenje i rotaciju. Osnovne datoteke mogu biti i očišćene i rotirane, dok već rotirane datoteke mogu biti samo očišćene ako odobrite tu dozvolu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Generic Log Level"
msgstr "Opći nivo dnevnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file.  WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Koji nivo detalja želite da se šalje u datoteku dnevnika. UPOZORENJE: Ostavljanje u bilo kojem statusu osim NONE ili LOW može brzo potrošiti vaš prostor na disku."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expand log details"
msgstr "Proširi detalje dnevnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of expansion do you want on the log file? Increase expansion can slow search results"
msgstr "Koji nivo proširenja želite za datoteku dnevnika? Povećano proširenje može usporiti rezultate pretrage"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Input Validation Issues"
msgstr "Zabilježi probleme validacije unosa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Record when request fields are accessed without going through proper input validation"
msgstr "Bilježi kada se poljima zahtjeva pristupa bez prolaska kroz odgovarajuću validaciju unosa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Tracing"
msgstr "Praćenje izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "A developer only option to trace the creation of Data Sources mainly around checks for uniqueness"
msgstr "Opcija samo za programere za praćenje kreiranja izvora podataka, uglavnom oko provjera jedinstvenosti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Ignored General Errors"
msgstr "Zabilježi zanemarene opće greške"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cacti will mask certain errors that are often times considered fatal and that would otherwise disable plugins and additionally confuse some users.  If you wish to see these errors instead, check the checkbox."
msgstr "Cacti će sakriti određene greške koje se često smatraju fatalnim i koje bi inače onemogućile dodatke te dodatno zbunile neke korisnike. Ako umjesto toga želite vidjeti ove greške, označite polje za potvrdu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Selective File Debug"
msgstr "Selektivno otklanjanje grešaka po datotekama"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select which files you wish to place in Debug mode regardless of the Generic Log Level setting.  Any files selected will be treated as they are in Debug mode."
msgstr "Odaberite koje datoteke želite staviti u režim otklanjanja grešaka (Debug) bez obzira na postavku općeg nivoa dnevnika. Sve odabrane datoteke bit će tretirane kao da su u Debug režimu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select File(s)"
msgstr "Odaberite datoteke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Files Selected"
msgstr "Odabrane datoteke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Selective Plugin Debug"
msgstr "Selektivno otklanjanje grešaka dodataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select which Plugins you wish to place in Debug mode regardless of the Generic Log Level setting.  Any files used by this plugin will be treated as they are in Debug mode."
msgstr "Odaberite koje dodatke želite staviti u režim otklanjanja grešaka bez obzira na postavku opšteg nivoa dnevnika. Sve datoteke koje ovaj dodatak koristi bit će tretirane kao da su u režimu otklanjanja grešaka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select Plugin(s)"
msgstr "Odaberite dodatak (dodatke)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Plugins Selected"
msgstr "Odabrani dodaci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Selective Device Debug"
msgstr "Selektivno otklanjanje grešaka uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of Device ID's that you wish to be in Debug mode during data collection.  This Debug level is only in place during the Cacti polling process."
msgstr "Zarezom odvojena lista ID-jeva uređaja za koje želite da budu u režimu otklanjanja grešaka tokom prikupljanja podataka. Ovaj nivo otklanjanja grešaka primjenjuje se samo tokom Cacti procesa ispitivanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Syslog/Eventlog Item Selection"
msgstr "Odabir stavki za Syslog/Eventlog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using Syslog/Eventlog for logging, the Cacti log messages that will be forwarded to the Syslog/Eventlog."
msgstr "Kada koristite Syslog/Eventlog za bilježenje, poruke Cacti dnevnika koje će biti proslijeđene u Syslog/Eventlog."

