#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Interface Speed"
msgstr "Podrazumijevana brzina interfejsa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Cacti can not determine the interface speed due to either ifSpeed or ifHighSpeed not being set or being zero, what maximum value do you wish on the resulting RRDfiles."
msgstr "Ako Cacti ne može odrediti brzinu interfejsa jer ifSpeed ili ifHighSpeed nisu postavljeni ili su jednaki nuli, koju maksimalnu vrijednost želite na rezultujućim RRD datotekama."

#: include/global_settings.php
