msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Prikupljanje podataka omogućeno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "Ako želite u potpunosti zaustaviti proces prikupljanja podataka, odznačite ovo polje."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Tip pollera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Tip pollera koji će se koristiti. Ova postavka će stupiti na snagu u sljedećem intervalu prikupljanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Interval prikupljanja koji se koristi. Ova postavka će uticati na to koliko često se RRDfile datoteke provjeravaju i ažuriraju. <strong><u>NAPOMENA: Ako promijenite ovu vrijednost, morate ponovo popuniti keš pollera. U suprotnom može doći do gubitka podataka.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "is not a valid choice."
msgstr "nije ispravan izbor."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Interval Cron/Daemon procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Učestalost pokretanja Cacti sakupljača podataka. Možete koristiti crontab, zakazani zadatak (za Windows) ili cactid systemd servis za upravljanje pokretanjem Cacti sakupljača podataka. Za uputstva o korištenju cactid demona, pregledajte datoteku README.md u direktoriju service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Balansiranje opterećenja procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Ako odaberete ovu opciju, Cacti će pokušati balansirati opterećenje svakog procesa polera ravnomjernom raspodjelom stavki polera po procesu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Širina izlaza za otklanjanje grešaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Ako odaberete ovu opciju, Cacti će provjeravati da li postoje izlazni podaci koji prelaze mogućnosti sistema Cacti za njihovo pohranjivanje i izdati upozorenje kada ih pronađe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena udaljenog agenta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Osvježavanje tabele polera po ciklusu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Ova postavka je namijenjena samo sistemima s jednim polerom kako bi se tabela izlaza polera ponovo izgradila u svakom ciklusu ispitivanja i spriječilo prebacivanje memorijske tabele na disk (swap) na veoma velikim sistemima s velikim bazama podataka koje bi mogle koristiti swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Replikacija sakupljača podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Interval sinhronizacije polera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani interval sinhronizacije ispitivanja koji se koristi pri kreiranju polera. Ova postavka utječe na to koliko se često udaljeni poleri provjeravaju i ažuriraju."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Onemogući replikaciju keša resursa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Podrazumijevano, glavni Cacti sakupljač podataka keširat će cijelu web stranicu i dodatke u keš resursa. Zatim će se udaljeni sakupljači podataka periodično ažurirati svim ažuriranjima s glavnog Cacti sakupljača podataka. Ovaj keš resursa u suštini omogućava udaljenim sakupljačima podataka da se sami nadograđuju. Ako ne želite koristiti ovu opciju, možete je onemogućiti pomoću ove postavke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Onemogući automatsku potpunu sinhronizaciju pri nadogradnji"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "Podrazumijevano, nakon nadogradnje glavnog Cacti sistema, izvršit će se potpuna sinhronizacija sa svim sakupljačima podataka. Ovaj proces može oduzeti mnogo vremena. Stoga, kako bismo omogućili brže dovršavanje nadogradnji, pružamo ovu opciju. Imajte na umu da ako je ovo onemogućeno, Cacti administrator mora prisilno pokrenuti ovaj proces iz interfejsa Sakupljači podataka nakon nadogradnje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Dodatne postavke sakupljača podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Zapisivanje nevažećih podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Kako želite da se zapisuju greške izlaza sakupljača podataka? Opcije uključuju: 'Detaljno' što detaljno navodi svaku grešku, 'Sažetak' što daje broj izlaznih grešaka po uređaju, i 'Ništa' što ne daje broj grešaka."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Sažetak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Detaljno"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Broj PHP servera skripti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Broj istovremenih procesa servera skripti koji se pokreću po jednom spine procesu. Prihvataju se vrijednosti između 1 i 15. Ovaj parametar će pomoći ako pokrećete više niti i skripti za server skripti i važi samo za sakupljač podataka spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Vrijednost isteka vremena skripte i servera skripti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and valid for both cmd.php and spine Data Collectors."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme koje će spine čekati da se skripta završi. Ova vrijednost isteka vremena je u sekundama i važi za oba sakupljača podataka, cmd.php i spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Output Not Empty Debouncing"
msgstr "Suzbijanje ponavljanja upozorenja za neprazan izlaz polera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with some data sources, your Email could be flooded with 'Poller Output Not Empty' warnings.  If this is happening, you can debounce the setting based upon this interval."
msgstr "Ako imate problema s nekim izvorima podataka, vaša e-pošta bi mogla biti preplavljena upozorenjima 'Poller Output Not Empty'. Ako se to dešava, možete suzbiti ponavljanje ovog upozorenja na osnovu ovog intervala."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Periodično ponovno indeksiranje svih uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Raspored ponovnog indeksiranja svih uređaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Koliko često želite ponovo indeksirati sve uređaje. Ovo ponovno indeksiranje će se izvršiti u ponoć prema učestalosti koju odaberete."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Sedmično u nedjelju"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunday"
msgstr "Mjesečno u nedjelju"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Runtime Variation/Deviance Settings"
msgstr "Postavke varijacije/odstupanja vremena izvršavanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "One Hour Count Warning Threshold"
msgstr "Prag upozorenja za broj u jednom satu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Poller Guarded Ratio (below) is reached breached more than this many times in an hour, a warning will be written to the Cacti log and an Email will be sent to the Primary Cact Administraror notifying them of the Poller runtime deviation."
msgstr "Kada je zaštićeni omjer polera (ispod) prekoračen više od ovoliko puta u jednom satu, upozorenje će biti upisano u Cacti zapisnik i e-pošta će biti poslana primarnom Cacti administratoru kako bi ga obavijestila o odstupanju vremena izvršavanja polera."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Poller Cycle"
msgstr "%d ciklus polera"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Poller Cycles"
msgstr "%d ciklusa polera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "One Hour Guarded Poller Ratio average/max Runtime"
msgstr "Jednosatni zaštićeni omjer prosječnog/maksimalnog vremena izvršavanja polera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Define a Guarded Poller Ratio average/max runtime (in percent).  Cacti will track breaches in these statistics and issue warnings to the Primary Cacti Administrator via Email when they happen."
msgstr "Definišite zaštićeni omjer prosječnog/maksimalnog vremena izvršavanja polera (u procentima). Cacti će pratiti prekoračenja u ovim statistikama i izdavati upozorenja primarnom Cacti administratoru putem e-pošte kada se dogode."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Percent"
msgstr "%d posto"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "24 Hour Guarded Poller Ratio average/max Runtime"
msgstr "24-satni zaštićeni omjer prosječnog/maksimalnog vremena izvršavanja polera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Running Tasks"
msgstr "Maksimalan broj aktivnih zadataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of concurrent scheduled tasks allowed to run concurrently."
msgstr "Maksimalan broj istovremenih zakazanih zadataka kojima je dozvoljeno da se izvršavaju istovremeno."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Scheduled Task"
msgstr "1 zakazani zadatak"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Scheduled Tasks"
msgstr "%d zakazanih zadataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Maximum Task Runtime"
msgstr "Podrazumijevano maksimalno vrijeme izvršavanja zadatka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Scheduled Task can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg se zakazani zadatak može izvršavati bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prisilnog zaustavljanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s minuta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Miscelanious Task Parallelism and Timeouts"
msgstr "Paralelizam i isteci vremena raznih zadataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For Tasks not managed by the Cacti Scheduler, there are their parallelism and timeout settings"
msgstr "Za zadatke kojima ne upravlja Cacti planer, ovdje su njihove postavke paralelizma i isteka vremena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena za statistiku izvora podataka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg se Cacti skripta za statistiku izvora podataka može izvršavati bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prisilnog zaustavljanja."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena za RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile Check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg se Cacti skripta za provjeru RRD datoteka može izvršavati bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida rada."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s sat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena za Poller komande"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg se Cacti skripta za pozadinske komande može izvršavati bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida rada. Ova skripta obavlja zadatke kao što su ponovno indeksiranje uređaja i uklanjanje uređaja sa udaljenih sakupljača podataka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Istovremeni procesi Poller komandi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Broj istovremenih procesa Poller komandi. U skupu Poller komandi bit će najviše jedna istovremena komanda po hostu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 proces"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d procesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena za pozadinsko generisanje održavanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg se Cacti skripta za održavanje može izvršavati bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida rada."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Istek vremena za Spikekill pozadinsko generisanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Maksimalno vrijeme tokom kojeg se Cacti Spikekill skripta može izvršavati bez generisanja greške isteka vremena i prekida rada."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Metoda autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Ugrađena autentifikacija</i> - Cacti upravlja autentifikacijom korisnika, što vam omogućava da kreirate korisnike i dodijelite im prava na različita područja unutar sistema Cacti.<br><br><i>Osnovna web autentifikacija</i> - Autentifikacijom upravlja web server. Korisnici se mogu dodati ili automatski kreirati pri prvoj prijavi ako je definisan šablonski korisnik, inače će se koristiti definisane dozvole za goste.<br><br><i>LDAP autentifikacija</i> - Omogućava autentifikaciju putem LDAP servera. Korisnici će biti automatski kreirani pri prvoj prijavi ako je definisan šablonski korisnik, inače će se koristiti definisane dozvole za goste. Ako PHP LDAP modul nije omogućen, LDAP autentifikacija se neće pojaviti kao opcija za odabir.<br><br><i>Autentifikacija više LDAP/AD domena</i> - Omogućava administratorima podršku za više različitih grupa iz različitih LDAP/AD direktorija za pristup Cacti resursima. Kao i kod LDAP autentifikacije, za korištenje ove metode potreban je PHP LDAP modul.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Podrška za kolačiće autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use.  Note, the client must use HTTPS to leverage this feature."
msgstr "Ako se korisnik autentifikuje i odabere 'Ostani prijavljen', na računaru korisnika će se kreirati kolačić autentifikacije koji tom korisniku omogućava da ostane prijavljen. Kolačić autentifikacije ističe nakon 90 dana nekorištenja. Napomena: klijent mora koristiti HTTPS da bi iskoristio ovu funkcionalnost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Settings"
msgstr "Postavke održavanja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Lockout Type"
msgstr "Tip zaključavanja za održavanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Cacti system is locked out for maintenance, how do you want the maintenance enforced?"
msgstr "Kada je Cacti sistem zaključan radi održavanja, kako želite da se održavanje primjenjuje?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Cacti Lockout Feature"
msgstr "Onemogući funkciju zaključavanja za Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin (all logins)"
msgstr "Primarni administrator (sve prijave)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin (lockout session only)"
msgstr "Primarni administrator (samo sesija zaključavanja)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Posebni korisnici"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Primarni administrator"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Naziv primarnog administratorskog naloga koji će automatski primati e-poruke kada sistem Cacti ima problema. Da biste primali ove e-poruke, provjerite jesu li vaše postavke pošte ispravne i da li administratorski nalog ima postavljenu adresu e-pošte."

#: include/global_settings.php login_providers.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Bez korisnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Gostujući korisnik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Naziv gostujućeg korisnika za pregled grafikona; podrazumijevano je 'Bez korisnika'."

#: include/global_settings.php login_providers.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Šablon korisnika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Naziv korisnika kojeg će Cacti koristiti kao šablon za nove Web Basic i LDAP korisnike; podrazumijevano je 'guest'. Ovom korisničkom nalogu će prijava biti onemogućena nakon odabira."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Zaključavanje naloga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Zaključaj naloge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Zaključaj nalog nakon ovoliko neuspjelih pokušaja u roku od 1 sata."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 pokušaj"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d pokušaja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Automatsko otključavanje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "Nalog će se automatski otključati nakon ovoliko minuta. Čak i ako se unese ispravna lozinka, nalog se neće otključati dok ovo vremensko ograničenje ne istekne. Maksimalno 1440 minuta (1 dan)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 dan"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pwned Checks (Online)"
msgstr "Pwned provjere (online)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pwned Check"
msgstr "Pwned provjera"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check password against haveibeenpwned.com"
msgstr "Provjeri lozinku putem servisa haveibeenpwned.com"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pwned Threshold"
msgstr "Pwned prag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Block use of a password once it reaches this reported usage level"
msgstr "Blokiraj korištenje lozinke kada dostigne ovaj prijavljeni nivo upotrebe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Localized 2FA"
msgstr "Lokalizovana 2FA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Localized 2FA"
msgstr "Omogući lokalizovanu 2FA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this option if you wish users to locally enable Two Factor Authentication for their accounts.  Note that most Enterprise level MFA does not require intervention by the Cacti Administrator."
msgstr "Označite ovu opciju ako želite da korisnici lokalno omoguće dvofaktorsku autentifikaciju za svoje naloge. Napomena: većina MFA sistema na nivou preduzeća ne zahtijeva intervenciju Cacti administratora."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Token Lifetime"
msgstr "Trajanje tokena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How long the Two Factor Auth Token lasts before being rechecked up to a max of 1 week."
msgstr "Koliko dugo traje token za dvofaktorsku autentifikaciju prije ponovne provjere, do maksimalno 1 sedmice."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Postavke osnovne autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Poruka o neuspjeloj prijavi kod osnovne autentifikacije"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Prilikom korištenja osnovne autentifikacije, ako dođe do problema pri mapiranju korisničkog imena na važeći Cacti nalog, korisnicima će biti prikazana poruka navedena ovdje. Može sadržavati i tekst i HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Datoteka mapiranja za osnovnu autentifikaciju"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Prilikom korištenja osnovne autentifikacije, ako osnovni nalog treba prevesti u drugi nalog za prijavu, ovdje možete navesti CSV datoteku za mapiranje osnovnog naloga na željeni nalog za prijavu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Zahtjevi složenosti za lokalne naloge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Minimalna dužina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Ovo je minimalna dužina dozvoljenih lozinki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj kombinaciju velikih i malih slova"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže i mala i velika slova."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj broj"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže najmanje 1 numerički znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Zahtijevaj specijalni znak"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da nove lozinke sadrže najmanje 1 specijalni znak."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Primijeni složenost na stare lozinke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Ovo će zahtijevati da sve stare lozinke također ispunjavaju nove uslove složenosti prilikom prijave. Ako nisu ispunjeni, prisilit će promjenu lozinke."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Istek neaktivnih računa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Ovo je maksimalan broj dana prije nego što neaktivni računi budu onemogućeni. Administratorski račun je izuzet iz ove politike."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Istek lozinke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Ovo je maksimalan broj dana prije nego što lozinka istekne."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Historija lozinki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Zapamti ovaj broj starih lozinki i zabrani njihovo ponovno korištenje."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 promjena"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d promjena"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Email Notification"
msgstr "Obavještenje e-poštom o računu"

#: include/global_settings.php
